# DUB.SAR 1.0 Example: Tablet Archive Persistence
# Difficulty: Mastery
# Concept: Persistent Archive & Working Tablets
# Mode: Scholar (Latin transliteration)
#
# Purpose:
#   Illustrates multi-tablet archival persistence, working tablet scratchpads,
#   and versioned lineage derivation.
#
# Expected Output:
#   0;15

problem

    consult tablet "reciprocals"

    reciprocal-of-four :
        4
        take entry from reciprocals

    working observations

    put 42 into observations at 10

    inscribe observations as tablet "observations"

    recorded-entry :
        10
        take entry from observations

result

    reciprocal-of-four
